## Combined Message-Command Sequences

### Complete Planning to Implementation Sequence

```
# Initialize planning with template
plan-mode: rules-workflow @parameters/rules/plan-mode/template-advanced.mdc

# [Create planning documents]

# Signal planning completion
planning-document-complete

# Initialize implementation
dev-mode: rules-workflow @parameters/rules/dev-mode/system-wide-enhancement.mdc

# [Implement changes]

# Signal implementation completion
implementation-complete
```

### Direct Implementation Sequence

```
# Initialize direct implementation
direct-mode: rules-workflow @parameters/rules/direct-mode/direct-implementation.mdc

# [Research and implement changes]

# Signal implementation completion
implementation-complete
```

